# Building REST APIs with Spring Boot - Part 1

<Section>

## Concepts

<IndexList>
  <IndexItem href="1-goodreads-application">Goodreads Application</IndexItem>
  <IndexItem href="modelClass">Creating a Model Class</IndexItem>
  <IndexItem href="serviceAndController">Creating Service and Controller Classes</IndexItem>
  <IndexItem href="getRequest">Get Books API</IndexItem>
  <IndexItem href="gettingSpecificBook">Get Book API</IndexItem>
  <IndexItem href="handlingExceptions">Handling Exceptions</IndexItem>
</IndexList>
 
