Here, the `@Autowired` annotation creates an instance of a Repository Interface, Spring Boot automatically provides an object that implements the methods defined in it (Including CRUD methods).

The methods provided by the `JpaRepository` are as follows:

| Method       | Description                                   |
| ------------ | --------------------------------------------- |
| findAll()    | Retrieves all Entities from database          |
| findById()   | Retrieves an Entity by its Primary Key        |
| save()       | Saves a given Entity                          |
| deleteById() | Deletes the Entity with the given Primary Key |

